<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 70-DAY SEASONAL T-BILLS YIELD 8.25 PCT.</title>
<headline>NZ 70-DAY SEASONAL T-BILLS YIELD 8.25 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield for NZ$125 million of 70-day seasonal treasury bills was 8.25 percent, with bids totalling NZ$508 million.</p>
<p>An offer of $125 million of 100-day seasonal bills yielded 8.171 percent, with bids worth $571 million.</p>
